SUMMARY:The Labour Day Weekend Pub-Club and Dance! (Harp Tavern) 
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello eveyone\,\n\nCome celebrate 
 the Labour Day long weekend with a night of drinks\, conversation\, live m
 usic and dancing! We’ll begin at the new **Harp Tavern** on Eglinton\, w
 here everyone can meet\, grab a beer or cocktail\, and get to know the gro
 up in a relaxed Irish-pub atmosphere. Then later we’ll head out together
  for a short walk to our **secret second location**\, where we’ll turn u
 p the energy with a live band\, music and dancing!\n\n\\*Joined by my othe
 r groups too\; so we can anticipate a fantastic evening!\n\nEvent Details 
 Below:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details
 :\n**The Labour Day Weekend Pub-Club and Dance!**\n\n**Hightlights:**\n\n*
  🍺 Meet us between 9:00 PM and 10:00 PM at The Harp Tavern\, 180 Eglint
 on Ave E\, Toronto.\n* 🍸 Start the evening casually with beers\, cockta
 ils\, conversation and a chance to meet some new people before we head out
  together.\n* 🎶 After we mix and mingle\, we’ll walk as a group to ou
 r secret second location for live music\, a live band and dancing.\n* 💃
  Come on your own or bring a friend. The idea is simply to socialize\, hav
 e some laughs\, enjoy the long weekend and make it a fun Friday night out!
 \n\nHosted by Steve Flemming — Soul City Social Club\n\n**Event fee:**\n
 Please pay $10 cash at the event or in advance by e-transfer to [Steveflem
 ming11@gmail.com](mailto:Steveflemming11@gmail.com)\n\\*one beverage and/o
 r appetitzer minimum at first location-please kindly support the second lo
 cation too- Thank you!\n\n**Parking and Subway:**\n\\*You can find free pa
 rking on Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton\n\\*Minutes walk from
  the Yonge and Eglinton subway too-even close to Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant
  station
