SUMMARY:The Saturday Night Long Weekend Dinner and Live Band Bash!
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nGood day everyone\,\n\nPlease join
  us for a great long weekend as we mix\, mingle\, make new friends\, dinne
 r party and dance the night away with a fabulous Live Band!\n\n\\*Joined b
 y my other social groups too\; so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out wi
 th lots of friendly peers to enjoy dinner and the game\n\n**\\*Meet us ins
 ide Smoke Show between 6:30 pm and 8:30 pm**\n\\*If you have to arrive aft
 er that\, still let the front door guy know you are with Steve's group so 
 he can direct you to us (but kindly do your best to arrive between 6:30 pm
  and 8:00 pm (as I can't promise seating after that)-Thank you!\n\n(Event 
 Details Below)\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host )\n\nEven
 t Details:\n**The Saturday Night Long Weekend Dinner and Live Band Bash!**
 \n\n-A fun\, interactive\, event with friends\, food\, reserved seating\, 
 Live Band\, DJ and Dancing!\n-Pool Table available\, and Patio too\n-Plent
 y of parking all around the venue and very close to Mt. Pleasant Station\n
 \n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only) when you arrive (HST is included)
 \nor e transfer in advance to [Steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://Steveflem
 ming11@gmail.com/)\n(One Beverage or Appetizer Minimum please)\n\n**-Arriv
 e any time between 6:30 pm and 8:30 pm inside the restaurant (ask or look 
 for Steve/Organizer when you arrive)**\n\\*If arriving after 8:30 you stil
 l need to let the guy at the front door know you are with Steve's group so
  he can properly direct you to us and help track our numbers- Thank you fo
 r your kind co-operation!\n\n(1 minute walk from the new Mt. Pleasant & Eg
 linton station)
