SUMMARY:Taylor-Massey Creek & Don River Walk + Ice Cream 🌳🍦9KM
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n## **Taylor-Massey Creek & Don Riv
 er Walk + Ice Cream** 🌳🍦\n\n**Taylor-Massey Creek** is a tributary o
 f the Don River\, winding its way through Scarborough and East York before
  meeting the Don. Named after two prominent Toronto families\, the Taylors
  were well-known for owning and operating the historic Don Valley Brick Wo
 rks.\n\nThis walk takes us along the scenic **Taylor-Massey Creek Trail**\
 , through the **Don Valley**\, and ends with a challenging hill climb befo
 re rewarding ourselves with **ice cream at Dairy Queen**. If ice cream isn
 ’t your thing\, you can continue with the group toward Broadview Station
 .\n\n📲Don't forget to join our **WhatsApp Group – [CLICK HERE!](https
 ://chat.whatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc)**\n\n***\n\n### **🕰 Meetup
  Details**\n\n**Start Location:** Outside the main entrance of Victoria Pa
 rk Station (on Victoria Park Road). Look for me in my Moose Hat 🦌.\n\n*
 *End Point:** Near Broadview Station *(we will not be returning to Victori
 a Park)*.\n\n***\n\n### **💵 Meetup Fee**\n\n**$5 cash in person** or **
 e-transfer** to: **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**\n\n***\n\n### **🥾 What t
 o Bring**\n\n* Water 💧\n* Comfortable walking shoes 👟\n* A snack 
 🥪\n* Bathroom breaks are limited — there’s only one near the very e
 nd of the walk.\n\n***\n\n### **🚶 Pace & Flexibility**\n\nWe’ll be le
 aving Victoria Park at a steady walking pace\, but you can leave anytime y
 ou like.\n\n***\n\n### **Please Notes**\n\n* Occasionally events need to b
 e cancelled — please check for updates before heading out.\n* You can **
 RSVP in advance or just show up** if you’re unsure you can make it.\n* T
 his group is open to **everyone** — single\, coupled\, shy\, social\, ne
 w in town\, or a long-time local.\n\nWe also host **movies\, hikes\, arts 
 & culture\, restaurants**\, and more — come be part of it!\n\n📧 **Con
 tact Mathew (Organizer):** Post a message on the wall or email **torontomo
 viesandoutings@hotmail.com**\n\n**Come for the trails.**\n**Stay for the i
 ce cream.**\n**Leave with a new connection — and maybe a new friend.** 
 🌳🍦💛
