SUMMARY:🌳🚶‍♂️ Eglinton West Trail & Mimico Creek + Swiss Chale
 t 🍗! 12KM
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\n**🌳🚶‍♂️ Eglinton West 
 Trail & Mimico Creek + Swiss Chalet 🍗**\n\nGolden trails\, sparkling cr
 eek\, great conversation… and Swiss Chalet after 🍗. We’re walking *
 *Eglinton West & Mimico Creek** this weekend — once it’s over\, it’s
  gone. Meet awesome people\, get fresh air\, and make memories you *won’
 t* get sitting at home 💬☀️.\n\n📱 Don't forget to join our **What
 sApp Group – [CLICK HERE](https://chat.whatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKA
 nc)**\n\n**📍 Meetup Details**\n🚌 **Start:** We’ll begin by taking 
 the **73 Bus** to Eglinton West.\n\n🚶‍♀️ **Route:** Follow the ci
 ty trail until we reach Mimico Creek\, take a short park break 🌳\, then
  continue back to **Royal York Subway Station** 🚇.\n\n📌 **Location:*
 * Inside Royal York Subway Station — by the stairs on the bus platform. 
 Look for me in my 🦌 Moose Hat!\n\n⏰ **Time:** We leave with the **10:
 55am bus** — I will only wait until departure.\n\n💵 **Fee:** $5 cash 
 💰 or e-transfer to **mathewmaclean@hotmail.com**\n\n**🎒 What to Brin
 g:**\n💧 Water\n👟 Good walking shoes\n🥪 Snack\n\n🚻 Bathroom sto
 p before you arrive (there *may* be facilities on the walk\, but not guara
 nteed)\n🏁 **End Spot:** Back at Royal York Subway Station\n\n🕒 **Lea
 ving Time:** Anytime you like — your pace\, your choice!\n\n**⚠️ Not
 es:**\n\n* Plans can change — please check for possible cancellations 
 🔔.\n* You can **just show up** if you’re not sure until the last minu
 te.\n\n💬 This group is open to *everyone* — singles\, couples\, socia
 l butterflies 🦋\, and anyone who wants to meet great people. We also ho
 st 🎥 movies\, 🥾 hikes\, 🎭 arts & culture outings\, and more.**[!]
 (https://chat.whatsapp.com/H59mSCbsAi018gYANrKAnc)**\n\n📩 **Organizer:*
 * Mathew — post a message on the wall or email **torontomoviesandoutings
 @hotmail.com** for questions.\n\n**Come for the trails.**\n**Stay for lunc
 h.**\n**Leave with a new connection — and maybe a new friend.** 🌳🍦
