SUMMARY:From Hello to Hangout
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHow to Turn a Good Conversation In
 to an Actual Connection\n\nLet’s say you start a conversation.. GREAT! T
 hen the problem is what happens after\, the "let's hang out sometime" that
  never turns into an actual plan\, the friendly chat that fades into nothi
 ng\, the acquaintance you never quite become friends with… the first dat
 e that never comes.\n\nThis workshop is all about the specific\, tangible 
 moves that turn a good conversation into a real friendship\, a great roman
 ce and maybe even a solid social circle.\n\n**In 60 minutes\, you'll learn
  how to:**\n\n* Lock in real plans on the spot\, instead of vague "let's e
 xchange numbers" energy\n* Build a group chat that takes on a life of its 
 own\n* Start a recurring hangout that makes you the person people gather a
 round\n* Deepen a friendship without oversharing (or staying stuck in smal
 l talk forever)\n* Become the person who connects others\n\nWhether you're
  rebuilding your social circle after a breakup\, new to a city\, or just t
 ired of conversations that go nowhere\, you'll leave with a concrete plan 
 and a cheat sheet to take with you.
